      "text": [
        " إِنَّ الشَّكَّ وَ الْمَعْصِيَةَ فِي النَّارِ لَيْسَا مِنَّا وَ لَا إِلَيْنَا ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Al Husayn Bin Muhammad, from Ahmad Bin Is’haq, from Bakr Bin Muhammad, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The doubter and the disobedient one would be in the Fire. He is neither from us<sup>asws</sup> nor to us<sup>asws</sup>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. Al-Husayn ibn Muhammad has narrated from Ahmad ibn Ishaq from Bakr ibn Muhammad from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) has said, ‘Doubts and disobedience are in the fire. It (doubt or people having doubts) is not from us nor is it directed to us.’” "
        ]
      }
